      "title": "1. Delay before data is available for query (data generated -> available)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "asap-prometheus-topk"
      },
      "description": "Per point, p50 and p99 over the window's points: from its generation until its window's data can be queried. Every point first waits for its window to end (up to 60 s). sketch and exact: then until the detector sent the window's answer to its Prometheus. store and query: then until prometheus-raw acknowledged the window's last raw point.",
